        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blackjack Roguelike in the Underworld: Bet Your Soul to Win Reincarnation</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an underworld gambling hall, moments away from having your soul devoured by Ammit.<br>Just as all hope seems lost, you are offered a final bargain:<br><strong>Survive twelve hours until dawn by continuously offering chips as tribute, and you may earn a chance at reincarnation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the clock ticking and your soul on the edge, can you seize this last opportunity and return to life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/429cfdaddc01b1d5e2ce76b1f6b36c66.avif?t=1770948739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras_big/429cfdaddc01b1d5e2ce76b1f6b36c66.avif?t=1770948739 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For twelve hours until dawn, you must continue offering chips as tribute to satisfy Ammit’s demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each in-game hour consists of up to three blackjack rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within these three attempts, you must gather enough chips to meet the required quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to meet Ammit’s demand, or if repeated losses leave you without enough chips to pay the tribute, the remaining cost must be paid with your own soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round is played as a game of blackjack, where you select cards from nine cards laid out on the field and aim to reach a total as close to 21 as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All nine cards are placed face down; however, their relative order is revealed, allowing you to see which cards are higher or lower than others. Using this information, you must infer which cards best suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, the dealer presents a target score that must be exceeded. Unless your total surpasses this threshold, you will earn no chips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of chips you obtain is calculated as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(the difference between your total and the target score) × item-based multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature 1: A New Blackjack Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game differs from traditional blackjack in two key ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, the cards you may use are limited to nine cards presented in advance. From these nine cards alone, you must determine how to reach a total of 21.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, all cards are placed face down, and only the relative order between adjacent cards is revealed as a hint. Because this information represents relative values, it is impossible to identify every card precisely. However, these hints play a crucial role in deciding which cards to select.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/cfa7f36611f26d32d18f07e338f9dd41.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/cfa7f36611f26d32d18f07e338f9dd41.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/cfa7f36611f26d32d18f07e338f9dd41.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, these two mechanics create a blackjack experience with a much higher level of strategic depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature 2: Item Builds and Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you clear one in-game hour, you are granted an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items increase multipliers based on the state of your cards, others enhance score differences, and some manipulate underlying statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/2239ce48119e4fd243b799186dd5be24.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/2239ce48119e4fd243b799186dd5be24.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/2239ce48119e4fd243b799186dd5be24.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ammit’s required tribute steadily increases with the passage of time, making effective use of items becomes the key to survival and success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature 3: Probability Control of Card Values</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, you are given opportunities to adjust the probability distribution of the cards used in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The available adjustments are determined at random, but when used effectively, they allow you to leverage your items more efficiently and strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
