eir relative order is revealed, allowing you to see which cards are higher or lower than others. Using this information, you must infer which cards best suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, the dealer presents a target score that must be exceeded. Unless your total surpasses this threshold, you will earn no chips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of chips you obtain is calculated as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(the difference between your total and the target score) × item-based multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature 1: A New Blackjack Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game differs from traditional blackjack in two key ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, the cards you may use are limited to nine cards presented in advance. From these nine cards alone, you must determine how to reach a total of 21.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/320b2b3f97217c47a3ef5482a45d8633.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, all cards are placed face down, and only the relative order between adjacent cards is revealed as a hint. Because this information represents relative values, it is impossible to identify every card precisely. However, these hints play a crucial role in deciding which cards to select.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla