een rounds, you are given opportunities to adjust the probability distribution of the cards used in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The available adjustments are determined at random, but when used effectively, they allow you to leverage your items more efficiently and strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.poster.avif?t=1770948739\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.webm?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976450/extras/ff6e2a3676c55c8ebbaefa95ea0aa41b.mp4?t=1770948739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
